# Matugen-generated colour files are deliberately *not* ignored. They have to be
# committed because several configs hard-require them: hypr/hyprland.lua does
# require("appearance.colors"), and rofi/waybar @import theirs, so a clone
# without them gets a Hyprland that will not start rather than one that is
# merely unthemed. firstboot.sh only runs matugen behind a confirm prompt, so
# the files cannot be treated as reliably regenerated.

